WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.199 --> 00:00:05.009
Who would win: SCP-096, the Shy Guy, or a
nuclear bomb?

00:00:05.009 --> 00:00:09.540
Nuclear bombs are some of the deadliest weapons
mankind has ever conceived - From their super-heated

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:12.219
blasts to their deadly radioactive fallout.

00:00:12.219 --> 00:00:17.170
While it’s likely the initial blast would
sear off 096’s flesh with its extreme heat,

00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:20.630
the Shy Guy’s true asset is its indestructible
skeleton.

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:25.610
If it survived the initial boom, its hyper-regenerative
ability would mean that it’s soon back on

00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:26.610
its feet.

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:30.610
The jury is out on whether the radiation would
make any difference on that front, but even

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:34.930
if it did, could you imagine how even more
terrifying a skeleton-only version of the

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:37.110
Shy Guy stalking us would be?

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:37.870
Yikes!

